      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T19:41:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This tracepoint and the corresponding `trace_trusty_std_call32_done` tracepoint surround  `while` loop that repeatedly calls `trusty_std_call_helper`. If I\u0027m understanding it correctly, we need to repeatedly perform `smc()` calls in case Trusty is interrupted in order to ensure that it has enough time to complete whatever operation was requested. So having this tracepoint span the entire sequence of repeated `smc()` calls will help give us a high level picture of how long it took to complete the operation.",
      "parentUuid": "ad8f375f_dd87a715",
      "revId": "3b6b7debc9c834ea4936035c76c49b13ae9fe580",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
